:"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":6,"title":"Boy saying good night to the kitchen","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":7,"title":"Boy saying good night to the objects in his bedroom","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":8,"title":"Monsters surprise a boy","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":9,"title":"Boy reacting to the monsters in his bedroom","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":10,"title":"Boy showing the monsters his teddy bear","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":11,"title":"Boy hugging monsters good night","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":12,"title":"Monster hiding under a bed grabs hold of the boy's legs","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":13,"title":"Boy says hello to the monster","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"},{"page":14,"title":"Boy falls asleep hugging the monsters","illustrator":"Lavanya Karthik","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2024"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/608394-subha-raatri-monu/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/608394-subha-raatri-monu/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ರಾತ್ರಿ ಮಲಗುವ ಹೊತ್ತು ಮತ್ತು ಮೋನು ಲೋಕಕ್ಕೆಲ್ಲ “ಶುಭ ರಾತ್ರಿ!” ಕೋರುವನು.","ಅಮ್ಮನನ್ನು ಅಪ್ಪಿಕೊಳ್ಳುವನು, ಅಪ್ಪನಿಗೊಂದು ಮುತ್ತು ಕೊಡುವನು,","“ಸವಿ ಕನಸುಗಳು!” ಎಂದ ಅವನು, “ಸುಖ ನಿದ್ದೆ ಬರಲಿ!”","“ಶುಭ ರಾತ್ರಿ, ಮೋನು.”"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/608394-subha-raatri-monu/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಪ್ರತಿಯೊಂದು ನಕ್ಷತ್ರಕ್ಕೂ ಅವನು ಮುತ್ತು ಕಳಿಸುವನು,","ಮೋಡಗಳಿಗೂ, ಹಕ್ಕಿಗಳಿಗೂ ಹಾಗೂ ಮರಗಳಿಗೂ."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/608394-subha-raatri-monu/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಪ್ರತಿಯೊಂದು ಹೂವಿಗೂ ಶುಭ ಕೋರುವನು,","ಹಾಗೂ ಗುಂಯ್‌ ಗುಡುವ ಪ್ರತೀ ದುಂಬಿಗೂ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/608394-subha-raatri-monu/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿ ಮಲಗು,” ಎಂದು ಅವನು ಗೋಡೆಯ ಮೇಲಿರುವ ಕಪಾಟಿಗೆ ಹೇಳುವನು ಹಾಗೂ","ಸಾಲಾಗಿ ಜೋಡಿಸಿರುವ ಅವನ ಪುಸ್ತಕಗಳಿಗೂ. “ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿ ವಿಶ್ರಮಿಸಿ,” ಎನ್ನುವನು ಪಾತ್ರೆ","ಪರಡಿಗಳಿಗೆ ಹಾಗೂ ಬಾಗಿಲ ಬಳಿ ನೇತಾಡುವ ಬಟ್ಟೆಗಳಿಗೂ.","“ಶುಭ ರಾತ್ರಿ, ಮೋನು.”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/608394-subha-raatri-monu/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಶುಭ ರಾತ್ರಿ,” ಎನ್ನುವನು ಮೋನು ಕಿಟಕಿಗಳಿಗೆ,","ಗೋಡೆಗಳಿಗೆ, ಛಾವಣಿಗೆ ಮತ್ತು ನೆಲಕ್ಕೆ.","“ಬೆಚ್ಚಗೆ ಮಲಗಿ,” ನಸುನಗುತ್ತಾ ತನ್ನ ಆಟಿಕೆಗಳನ್ನು ಜೋಡಿಸಿಡುವನು, ಹಾಗೂ “ಶುಭ ರಾತ್ರಿ,” ಕೊನೆಯದಾಗಿ…"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/608394-subha-raatri-monu/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಓಹ್!"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/608394-subha-raatri-monu/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/608394-subha-raatri-monu/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/608394-subha-raatri-monu/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಶಾಂತರಾಗಿ,” ಎನ್ನುವನು ಮೋನು ಪೆಡಂಭೂತಗಳಿಗೆ,","ಒಂದೊಂದಾಗಿ ಅವುಗಳನ್ನು ಮಲಗಿಸುತ್ತ.","“ಕಣ್ಣು ಮುಚ್ಚಿ! ನಿದ್ದೆ ಹೋಗಿ!”ಎನ್ನುತ್ತಾ,","ಪ್ರತಿಯೊಂದು ಪೆಡಂಭೂತದ ನೆತ್ತಿಗೂ ಮುತ್ತಿಡುವನು."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/608394-subha-raatri-monu/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/608394-subha-raatri-monu/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಸವಿಗನಸು,” ಎನ್ನುವನು ಅವನು ಇಡೀ ಜಗತ್ತಿಗೇ.","“ಹಾಗೂ ಸವಿಸವೀ ಕನಸು ನನಗೂ.”"]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/608394-subha-raatri-monu/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಶುಭ ರಾತ್ರಿ, ಮೋನು.”"]}],"wordCount":115}